{"schemaVersion":"kfc_portal_schema_v1","generatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:48:24.656929+00:00","type":"news","id":"news_aa7ab51c8004f079030a","item":{"id":"news_aa7ab51c8004f079030a","type":"news","title":"林肯的歪屋曾险些被拆除;隐藏的木结构拯救了它","sourceId":"timesofindia.indiatimes.com","status":"new","publishedAt":"2026-08-16T22:35:36","updatedAt":"2026-08-16T16:06:51.301946Z","summary":"1933年一次拆除作业中,施工人员意外发现了一座可追溯至16世纪的非凡木结构建筑——歪屋。这颗建筑瑰宝险些被彻底摧毁,此后经过一系列保护工作,修复了死亡钟甲虫造成的损害以及此前不当修缮带来的问题。借助大额资金,大规模修复即将完成,届时将为游客提供独特的假日住宿和社区空间,让其感受这里丰富的历史。","articleId":"","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-1933-lincolns-crooked-house-was-marked-for-demolition-work-revealed-a-hidden-timber-framed-building-behind-its-brick-faade-and-saved-it-today-it-is-one-of-the-cathedral-quarters-most-photographed-buildings/articleshow/133277131.cms"}}